  <jpcrp_cor:MetricsDescriptionOfMetricsRelatedToPolicyOnDevelopmentOfHumanResourcesAndInternalEnvironmentAndTargetsAndPerformanceUsingSuchMetrics contextRef="CurrentYearInstant_Row1Member">技能検定等 技術面で有効な資格取得者比率</jpcrp_cor:MetricsDescriptionOfMetricsRelatedToPolicyOnDevelopmentOfHumanResourcesAndInternalEnvironmentAndTargetsAndPerformanceUsingSuchMetrics>
  <jpcrp_cor:TargetPeriodDescriptionOfMetricsRelatedToPolicyOnDevelopmentOfHumanResourcesAndInternalEnvironmentAndTargetsAndPerformanceUsingSuchMetrics contextRef="CurrentYearInstant_Row1Member">2026年３月まで</jpcrp_cor:TargetPeriodDescriptionOfMetricsRelatedToPolicyOnDevelopmentOfHumanResourcesAndInternalEnvironmentAndTargetsAndPerformanceUsingSuchMetrics>
  <jpcrp_cor:MetricsUnitDescriptionOfMetricsRelatedToPolicyOnDevelopmentOfHumanResourcesAndInternalEnvironmentAndTargetsAndPerformanceUsingSuchMetrics contextRef="CurrentYearInstant_Row1Member">％</jpcrp_cor:MetricsUnitDescriptionOfMetricsRelatedToPolicyOnDevelopmentOfHumanResourcesAndInternalEnvironmentAndTargetsAndPerformanceUsingSuchMetrics>
  <jpcrp_cor:MetricsDescriptionOfMetricsRelatedToPolicyOnDevelopmentOfHumanResourcesAndInternalEnvironmentAndTargetsAndPerformanceUsingSuchMetrics contextRef="CurrentYearInstant_Row2Member">男性労働者の育児休業取得率</jpcrp_cor:MetricsDescriptionOfMetricsRelatedToPolicyOnDevelopmentOfHumanResourcesAndInternalEnvironmentAndTargetsAndPerformanceUsingSuchMetrics>
